touchglass-scdaemon was written for this project. Its design draws on:

- gpg-tap-notifier-macos, Apache License 2.0: the idea of wrapping scdaemon as gpg-agent's
  scdaemon-program and inferring touch waits from response timing.
  https://github.com/palantir/gpg-tap-notifier-macos
- scdaemon-proxy by klali: an earlier scdaemon wrapper for touch notifications.
  https://github.com/klali/scdaemon-proxy

No code from either project is included.
